        <name>PipeFD</name>
        <qualifiedname>llvm::ListeningSocket::PipeFD</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>If a separate thread calls <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_listening_socket_1a682299af2a92a43ba340ce4a0ce736ba" kindref="member">ListeningSocket::shutdown</ref>, the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_listening_socket" kindref="compound">ListeningSocket</ref> file descriptor (FD) could be closed while ::poll is waiting for it to be ready to perform a I/O operations. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>::poll will continue to block even after FD is closed so use a self-pipe mechanism to get ::poll to return </para>
        </detaileddescription>
